{"author":"Unknown","author_email":"","data":{"content_hash":"e9f02c7d234eaa49945de184647735c3fa5cfe3961291b8f7a095e31571abbde","digest":{"component_or_area":"LLM provider framework and documentation","key_entities":["docs/adr/0059-llm-provider-seam-and-support-tiers.md","docs/llm-framework.md","docs/env-vars.md","README.md","providers.py","capabilities.py","runner.py","bedrock_model.py","provider_factory","ModelProfile","provider_provenance","REBAR_LLM_MODEL","REBAR_LLM_BEDROCK_REGION","KNOWN_PROVIDER_NAMES","_GATEWAY_PROVIDER_NAMES"],"problem_keywords":["ADR","documentation","provider seam","two-tier support policy","pydantic-ai","Bedrock","Anthropic","LLM framework","provider registry","capabilities","verdict provenance","best-effort","first-class"],"propositions":["The LLM provider seam, tier policy, Bedrock path, and tier-stamped verdicts exist in code but are not documented, requiring an ADR to record decisions and rejected alternatives to prevent future re-litigation.","Provider support is currently documented as pydantic-ai-driven resolution, but rebar owns a registry that intercepts and checks provider qualification before falling back to pydantic-ai, with specific rejection of LiteLLM in-process, gateway-fronted Bedrock, and cross-provider fallback.","The two-tier model (first-class for Anthropic/Bedrock with native builders; best-effort for OpenAI-compatible via gateway/base_url) must be formally defined with tier determination logic, capabilities guarantees per tier, and what consumers can infer from a stamped tier in signed verdicts.","Operational findings from the epic—IMDS reachability at hop-limit 1, Bedrock region resolution independent of credentials, prompt caching working with inference profiles, model-dependent caching failures—must be recorded so they are not rediscovered.","The docs/llm-framework.md provider section contains stale line references, false claims about provider resolution and Bedrock absence, wrong numeric defaults, and missing documentation of Bedrock, tiers, and env-vars; regenerated docs/env-vars.md must produce no diff."]},"digest_hash_version":1,"model":"bedrock:us.anthropic.claude-opus-4-8","schema":"ticket_digest_v1"},"env_id":"b2b5c498-2f67-4ae3-bafc-eca40294bec2","event_type":"TICKET_DIGEST","timestamp":1785821651322777730,"uuid":"ddab55a2-b4e1-400c-b163-73ca34014a44"}